WEBVTT

00:02:59.642 --> 00:03:01.976
And he said to me that anything
over six minutes

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:06.210
you have a serious risk
of hypoxic brain damage.

00:03:08.059 --> 00:03:10.850
So, I took that as a challenge, basically.

00:03:10.874 --> 00:03:11.976
(Laughter)

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:18.527
My first try, I figured
that I could do something similar,

00:03:18.595 --> 00:03:20.976
and I created a water tank,

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:24.544
and I filled it with ice
and freezing cold water.

00:03:24.568 --> 00:03:26.976
And I stayed inside of that water tank

00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:29.976
hoping my core temperature
would start to drop.

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:31.403
And I was shivering.